{"id":"64c3e464cdfafba6","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/356_时序类型论_Temporal_Type_Theory.md","title":"356 时序类型论 Temporal Type Theory","display":"356_时序类型论_Temporal_Type_Theory","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"356-时序类型论-Temporal-Type-Theory\">356 时序类型论 Temporal Type Theory</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。固定可数无限项变量集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}_{T}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}_{T}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>、可数时刻变量集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tick}_{T}=\\{\\theta_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tick}_{T}=\\{\\theta_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span> 与可数基本类型集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Base}_{T}\">\\(\\mathsf{Base}_{T}\\)</span>。时刻上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TimeCtx}_{T}\">\\(\\mathsf{TimeCtx}_{T}\\)</span> 是有限时刻变量序列，项上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}_{T}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ctx}_{T}\\)</span> 是变量互异的有限类型序列。时序判断集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Jud}_{T}\">\\(\\mathsf{Jud}_{T}\\)</span> 由形如</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>的判断组成。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\Theta\">\\(\\theta\\in\\Theta\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta+1\">\\(\\theta+1\\)</span> 是由时刻后继构造子形成的时刻表达式。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-类型与项构造\">2. 类型与项构造</h1>\n<p>类型集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_{T}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_{T}\\)</span> 是满足下列子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathsf{Base}_{T}\">\\(b\\in\\mathsf{Base}_{T}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{base}(b)\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{T}\">\\(\\mathsf{base}(b)\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{T}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{T}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{T}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\">\\(A\\to B\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\times B\">\\(A\\times B\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_{T}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_{T}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{T}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{T}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcirc A\">\\(\\bigcirc A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\square_t A\">\\(\\square_t A\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lozenge_t A\">\\(\\lozenge_t A\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_{T}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_{T}\\)</span>。其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcirc\">\\(\\bigcirc\\)</span> 表示下一时刻，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\square_t\">\\(\\square_t\\)</span> 表示从当前时刻起保持，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lozenge_t\">\\(\\lozenge_t\\)</span> 表示在某个后继时刻给出。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}_{T}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}_{T}\\)</span> 是满足下列子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>变量、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda x.M\">\\(\\lambda x.M\\)</span>、应用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"MN\">\\(MN\\)</span>、配对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle M,N\\rangle\">\\(\\langle M,N\\rangle\\)</span>、投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1(M)\">\\(\\pi_1(M)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_2(M)\">\\(\\pi_2(M)\\)</span> 是项构造子。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是项，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{next}(M)\">\\(\\mathsf{next}(M)\\)</span> 是项。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是项，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{prev}(M)\">\\(\\mathsf{prev}(M)\\)</span> 是项。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是项，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{always}(M)\">\\(\\mathsf{always}(M)\\)</span> 是项。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是项，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{unalways}(M)\">\\(\\mathsf{unalways}(M)\\)</span> 是项。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 是时刻表达式，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{eventually}(\\tau,M)\">\\(\\mathsf{eventually}(\\tau,M)\\)</span> 是项。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\">\\(M,N\\)</span> 是项且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{T}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{T}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{letevent}(x,M,N)\">\\(\\mathsf{letevent}(x,M,N)\\)</span> 是项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 中绑定。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-时刻移位、自由变量与替换\">3. 时刻移位、自由变量与替换</h1>\n<p>时刻表达式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Time}_{T}\">\\(\\mathsf{Time}_{T}\\)</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Tick}_{T}\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Tick}_{T}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau+1\">\\(\\tau+1\\)</span> 闭包生成。定义时刻移位 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(\\tau)=\\tau+1\">\\(s(\\tau)=\\tau+1\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=(x_1:A_1,\\ldots,x_n:A_n)\">\\(\\Gamma=(x_1:A_1,\\ldots,x_n:A_n)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(\\Gamma)\">\\(s(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x_1:s(A_1),\\ldots,x_n:s(A_n))\">\\((x_1:s(A_1),\\ldots,x_n:s(A_n))\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(A)\">\\(s(A)\\)</span> 对类型递归作用并满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s(\\bigcirc A)=\\bigcirc s(A),\\quad s(\\square_t A)=\\square_t s(A),\\quad s(\\lozenge_t A)=\\lozenge_t s(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s(\\bigcirc A)=\\bigcirc s(A),\\quad s(\\square_t A)=\\square_t s(A),\\quad s(\\lozenge_t A)=\\lozenge_t s(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"3.1-时刻上下文与-shift-action\">3.1 时刻上下文与 shift action</h2>\n<p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s(\\mathsf{base}(b))=\\mathsf{base}(b),\n\\qquad\ns(A\\to B)=s(A)\\to s(B),\n\\qquad\ns(A\\times B)=s(A)\\times s(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s(\\mathsf{base}(b))=\\mathsf{base}(b),\n\\qquad\ns(A\\to B)=s(A)\\to s(B),\n\\qquad\ns(A\\times B)=s(A)\\times s(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>时刻上下文形成关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TimeCtxForm}_{T}\n=\n\\{((),\\varnothing\\ \\mathsf{timectx})\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Theta\\ \\mathsf{timectx}),\\Theta,\\theta\\ \\mathsf{timectx}):\n\\theta\\notin\\Theta\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{TimeCtxForm}_{T}\n=\n\\{((),\\varnothing\\ \\mathsf{timectx})\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Theta\\ \\mathsf{timectx}),\\Theta,\\theta\\ \\mathsf{timectx}):\n\\theta\\notin\\Theta\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项自由变量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{T}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{T}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathsf{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{T})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{T}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{T}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathsf{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{T})\\)</span> 的变量、函数、积子句与简单类型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>-演算一致；新增子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(\\mathsf{next}(M))=\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(M),\\quad \\operatorname{FV}_{T}(\\mathsf{prev}(M))=\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(M),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(\\mathsf{next}(M))=\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(M),\\quad \\operatorname{FV}_{T}(\\mathsf{prev}(M))=\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(M),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(\\mathsf{always}(M))=\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(M),\\quad \\operatorname{FV}_{T}(\\mathsf{unalways}(M))=\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(M),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(\\mathsf{always}(M))=\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(M),\\quad \\operatorname{FV}_{T}(\\mathsf{unalways}(M))=\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(M),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(\\mathsf{eventually}(\\tau,M))=\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(M),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(\\mathsf{eventually}(\\tau,M))=\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(M),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(\\mathsf{letevent}(x,M,N))=\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(M)\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(N)\\setminus\\{x\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(\\mathsf{letevent}(x,M,N))=\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(M)\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(N)\\setminus\\{x\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定变量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{T}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{T}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathsf{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{T})\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{T}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{T}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathsf{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{T})\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{T}(x)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{T}(\\lambda x.M)=\\operatorname{BV}_{T}(M)\\cup\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{T}(x)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{T}(\\lambda x.M)=\\operatorname{BV}_{T}(M)\\cup\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{T}(\\mathsf{letevent}(x,M,N))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{T}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{T}(N)\\cup\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{T}(\\mathsf{letevent}(x,M,N))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{T}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{T}(N)\\cup\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{next}\">\\(\\mathsf{next}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{prev}\">\\(\\mathsf{prev}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{always}\">\\(\\mathsf{always}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{unalways}\">\\(\\mathsf{unalways}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{eventually}\">\\(\\mathsf{eventually}\\)</span>、应用、配对和投影上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{T}\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{T}\\)</span> 取显示子项的并集。</p>\n<p>时刻自由变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}:\\mathsf{Time}_{T}\\cup\\mathsf{Ty}_{T}\\cup\\mathsf{Tm}_{T}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathsf{fin}}(\\mathsf{Tick}_{T})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}:\\mathsf{Time}_{T}\\cup\\mathsf{Ty}_{T}\\cup\\mathsf{Tm}_{T}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathsf{fin}}(\\mathsf{Tick}_{T})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(\\theta)=\\{\\theta\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(\\tau+1)=\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(\\tau),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(\\theta)=\\{\\theta\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(\\tau+1)=\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(\\tau),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(\\bigcirc A)=\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(\\square_\\tau A)=\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(\\tau)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(\\lozenge_\\tau A)=\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(\\tau)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(\\bigcirc A)=\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(\\square_\\tau A)=\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(\\tau)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(\\lozenge_\\tau A)=\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(\\tau)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(\\mathsf{eventually}(\\tau,M))=\n\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(\\tau)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(\\mathsf{eventually}(\\tau,M))=\n\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(\\tau)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}_{T}(M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>时刻替换</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TSub}_{T}:(\\mathsf{Time}_{T}\\cup\\mathsf{Ty}_{T}\\cup\\mathsf{Tm}_{T})\\times\\mathsf{Tick}_{T}\\times\\mathsf{Time}_{T}\\to(\\mathsf{Time}_{T}\\cup\\mathsf{Ty}_{T}\\cup\\mathsf{Tm}_{T})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TSub}_{T}:(\\mathsf{Time}_{T}\\cup\\mathsf{Ty}_{T}\\cup\\mathsf{Tm}_{T})\\times\\mathsf{Tick}_{T}\\times\\mathsf{Time}_{T}\\to(\\mathsf{Time}_{T}\\cup\\mathsf{Ty}_{T}\\cup\\mathsf{Tm}_{T})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E[\\theta:=\\tau]_t\">\\(E[\\theta:=\\tau]_t\\)</span>，并满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta[\\theta:=\\tau]_t=\\tau,\\qquad\n\\eta[\\theta:=\\tau]_t=\\eta\\quad(\\eta\\ne\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta[\\theta:=\\tau]_t=\\tau,\\qquad\n\\eta[\\theta:=\\tau]_t=\\eta\\quad(\\eta\\ne\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\rho+1)[\\theta:=\\tau]_t=(\\rho[\\theta:=\\tau]_t)+1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\rho+1)[\\theta:=\\tau]_t=(\\rho[\\theta:=\\tau]_t)+1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\square_\\rho A)[\\theta:=\\tau]_t=\n\\square_{\\rho[\\theta:=\\tau]_t}(A[\\theta:=\\tau]_t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\square_\\rho A)[\\theta:=\\tau]_t=\n\\square_{\\rho[\\theta:=\\tau]_t}(A[\\theta:=\\tau]_t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\lozenge_\\rho A)[\\theta:=\\tau]_t=\n\\lozenge_{\\rho[\\theta:=\\tau]_t}(A[\\theta:=\\tau]_t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\lozenge_\\rho A)[\\theta:=\\tau]_t=\n\\lozenge_{\\rho[\\theta:=\\tau]_t}(A[\\theta:=\\tau]_t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{eventually}(\\rho,M)[\\theta:=\\tau]_t=\n\\mathsf{eventually}(\\rho[\\theta:=\\tau]_t,M[\\theta:=\\tau]_t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{eventually}(\\rho,M)[\\theta:=\\tau]_t=\n\\mathsf{eventually}(\\rho[\\theta:=\\tau]_t,M[\\theta:=\\tau]_t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{T}(X)=x_m\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}_{T}(X)=x_m\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:x_i\\notin X\\}\">\\(m=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:x_i\\notin X\\}\\)</span>。捕获避免替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{T}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{T}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{T}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{T}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{T}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{T}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{T}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{T}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{T}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{T}\\)</span> 由绑定体函数控制：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BSub}_{T}(y,E,x,N)=\n\\begin{cases}\nE,&amp;y=x,\\\\\nE[x:=N],&amp;y\\ne x\\ \\wedge\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(N),\\\\\n(E[y:=z])[x:=N],&amp;y\\ne x\\ \\wedge\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(N),\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BSub}_{T}(y,E,x,N)=\n\\begin{cases}\nE,&amp;y=x,\\\\\nE[x:=N],&amp;y\\ne x\\ \\wedge\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(N),\\\\\n(E[y:=z])[x:=N],&amp;y\\ne x\\ \\wedge\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(N),\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{T}(\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(E)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(N)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\">\\(z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{T}(\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(E)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(N)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\\)</span>。于是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\lambda y.M)[x:=N]=\\lambda y.\\operatorname{BSub}_{T}(y,M,x,N),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\lambda y.M)[x:=N]=\\lambda y.\\operatorname{BSub}_{T}(y,M,x,N),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{letevent}(y,M_0,N_0)[x:=N]=\n\\mathsf{letevent}(y,M_0[x:=N],\\operatorname{BSub}_{T}(y,N_0,x,N)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{letevent}(y,M_0,N_0)[x:=N]=\n\\mathsf{letevent}(y,M_0[x:=N],\\operatorname{BSub}_{T}(y,N_0,x,N)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{T}\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha^{T}\\)</span> 为所有满足下列条件的关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的交：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是等价关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{letevent}\">\\(\\mathsf{letevent}\\)</span> 的绑定变量改名对；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 对所有时序项构造子的同位置参数保持相容。</p>\n<p>定义稳定项谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{stable}_T(\\Theta;\\Gamma;M)\">\\(\\mathsf{stable}_T(\\Theta;\\Gamma;M)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{T}(M)\\)</span> 中每个变量在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 中的类型不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcirc B\">\\(\\bigcirc B\\)</span> 形状。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-类型规则\">4. 类型规则</h1>\n<p>变量和函数、积规则为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{x:A\\in\\Gamma}{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash x:A},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Theta;\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash M:B}{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda x.M:A\\to B},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{x:A\\in\\Gamma}{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash x:A},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Theta;\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash M:B}{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda x.M:A\\to B},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\to B\\quad \\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash N:A}{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash MN:B}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\to B\\quad \\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash N:A}{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash MN:B}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>下一时刻规则为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:A}{\\Theta;s(\\Gamma)\\vdash \\mathsf{next}(M):\\bigcirc A}\n\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:\\bigcirc A}{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash \\mathsf{prev}(M):A}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:A}{\\Theta;s(\\Gamma)\\vdash \\mathsf{next}(M):\\bigcirc A}\n\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:\\bigcirc A}{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash \\mathsf{prev}(M):A}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第二条规则只能用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=s(\\Gamma_0)\">\\(\\Gamma=s(\\Gamma_0)\\)</span> 的判断；此侧条件保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{prev}\">\\(\\mathsf{prev}\\)</span> 只消去来自后继层的项。</p>\n<p>保持规则为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\Theta;\\varnothing\\vdash M:A}{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash \\mathsf{always}(M):\\square_t A}\n\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:\\square_t A}{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash \\mathsf{unalways}(M):A}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{\\Theta;\\varnothing\\vdash M:A}{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash \\mathsf{always}(M):\\square_t A}\n\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:\\square_t A}{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash \\mathsf{unalways}(M):A}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>存在后继时刻规则为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\Theta,\\theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:A}{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash \\mathsf{eventually}(\\theta,M):\\lozenge_t A}\n\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:\\lozenge_t A\\quad \\Theta,\\theta;\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash N:B}{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash \\mathsf{letevent}(x,M,N):B}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{\\Theta,\\theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:A}{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash \\mathsf{eventually}(\\theta,M):\\lozenge_t A}\n\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:\\lozenge_t A\\quad \\Theta,\\theta;\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash N:B}{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash \\mathsf{letevent}(x,M,N):B}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-归约与推导\">5. 归约与推导</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to^0_T\">\\(\\to^0_T\\)</span> 是根项归约关系，包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 归约、积投影归约以及</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{prev}(\\mathsf{next}(M))\\to_T M,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{prev}(\\mathsf{next}(M))\\to_T M,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{unalways}(\\mathsf{always}(M))\\to_T M,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{unalways}(\\mathsf{always}(M))\\to_T M,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{letevent}(x,\\mathsf{eventually}(\\tau,M),N)\\to_T N[M/x].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{letevent}(x,\\mathsf{eventually}(\\tau,M),N)\\to_T N[M/x].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>一步归约 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_T\">\\(\\to_T\\)</span> 是包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to^0_T\">\\(\\to^0_T\\)</span> 并在项构造子位置下闭合的最小关系。时序类型推导树是有限有根树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_0\">\\(T_0\\)</span> 与标记函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell:T_0\\to\\mathsf{Jud}_{T}\">\\(\\ell:T_0\\to\\mathsf{Jud}_{T}\\)</span>，每个节点的直接子节点标记列和该节点标记组成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{T}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{T}\\)</span> 的一个元素。若存在根标记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\">\\(\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\)</span> 的推导树，则记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash_T M:A\">\\(\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash_T M:A\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>初始判断族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{T}\n=\n\\{\\varnothing;\\varnothing\\ \\mathsf{ctx}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash b\\ \\mathsf{type}:b\\in\\mathsf{Base}_{T},\\Theta;\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash x:A:x:A\\in\\Gamma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{T}\n=\n\\{\\varnothing;\\varnothing\\ \\mathsf{ctx}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash b\\ \\mathsf{type}:b\\in\\mathsf{Base}_{T},\\Theta;\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash x:A:x:A\\in\\Gamma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>时序类型推导树的叶节点必须属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{T}\">\\(\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{T}\\)</span> 或由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{T}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{T}\\)</span> 的零前提规则实例给出。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Der}_{T}\n=\n\\{(T_0,r,\\ell):T_0\\text{ 是非空有限有根树},r\\in T_0,\\ell:T_0\\to\\mathsf{Jud}_{T},\n\\text{ 且每个节点的子节点列与节点标记属于 }\\mathsf{Rule}_{T}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Der}_{T}\n=\n\\{(T_0,r,\\ell):T_0\\text{ 是非空有限有根树},r\\in T_0,\\ell:T_0\\to\\mathsf{Jud}_{T},\n\\text{ 且每个节点的子节点列与节点标记属于 }\\mathsf{Rule}_{T}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标差异对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{T}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Tick}_{T},\\mathsf{TimeCtx}_{T},s,\\bigcirc,\\square_t,\\lozenge_t,\n\\mathsf{next},\\mathsf{prev},\\mathsf{always},\\mathsf{unalways},\\mathsf{eventually},\\mathsf{letevent},\\to^0_T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{T}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Tick}_{T},\\mathsf{TimeCtx}_{T},s,\\bigcirc,\\square_t,\\lozenge_t,\n\\mathsf{next},\\mathsf{prev},\\mathsf{always},\\mathsf{unalways},\\mathsf{eventually},\\mathsf{letevent},\\to^0_T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中时刻变量、移位函数和三类时序类型构造子属于对象系统；时间流语义不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{T}\">\\(\\mathsf{Delta}_{T}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{T}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{T}\\)</span> 为下列关系的并集：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{T,\\to}\n=\n\\{((\\Theta;\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash M:B),\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda x.M:A\\to B)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\to B,\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash N:A),\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash MN:B)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{T,\\to}\n=\n\\{((\\Theta;\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash M:B),\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda x.M:A\\to B)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\to B,\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash N:A),\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash MN:B)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>积关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{T,\\times}\n=\n\\{((\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:A,\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash N:B),\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash\\langle M,N\\rangle:A\\times B)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash P:A\\times B),\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash\\pi_1(P):A)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash P:A\\times B),\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash\\pi_2(P):B)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{T,\\times}\n=\n\\{((\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:A,\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash N:B),\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash\\langle M,N\\rangle:A\\times B)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash P:A\\times B),\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash\\pi_1(P):A)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash P:A\\times B),\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash\\pi_2(P):B)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>下一时刻关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{T,\\bigcirc}\n=\n\\{((\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:A),\\Theta;s(\\Gamma)\\vdash\\mathsf{next}(M):\\bigcirc A)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Theta;s(\\Gamma)\\vdash M:\\bigcirc A),\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathsf{prev}(M):A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{T,\\bigcirc}\n=\n\\{((\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:A),\\Theta;s(\\Gamma)\\vdash\\mathsf{next}(M):\\bigcirc A)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Theta;s(\\Gamma)\\vdash M:\\bigcirc A),\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathsf{prev}(M):A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>保持和最终可能关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{T,\\square}\n=\n\\{((\\Theta;\\varnothing\\vdash M:A),\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathsf{always}(M):\\square_t A)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:\\square_t A),\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathsf{unalways}(M):A)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{T,\\square}\n=\n\\{((\\Theta;\\varnothing\\vdash M:A),\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathsf{always}(M):\\square_t A)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:\\square_t A),\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathsf{unalways}(M):A)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{T,\\lozenge}\n=\n\\{((\\Theta,\\theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:A),\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathsf{eventually}(\\theta,M):\\lozenge_t A)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:\\lozenge_t A,\\Theta,\\theta;\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash N:B),\n\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathsf{letevent}(x,M,N):B)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{T,\\lozenge}\n=\n\\{((\\Theta,\\theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:A),\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathsf{eventually}(\\theta,M):\\lozenge_t A)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:\\lozenge_t A,\\Theta,\\theta;\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash N:B),\n\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathsf{letevent}(x,M,N):B)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>根归约闭包对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{next}\">\\(\\mathsf{next}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{prev}\">\\(\\mathsf{prev}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{always}\">\\(\\mathsf{always}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{unalways}\">\\(\\mathsf{unalways}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{eventually}\">\\(\\mathsf{eventually}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{letevent}\">\\(\\mathsf{letevent}\\)</span> 和普通函数/积构造的每个直接子项分别给出一步闭包规则；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{prev}\">\\(\\mathsf{prev}\\)</span> 的规则只在前提上下文可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(\\Gamma)\">\\(s(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 时适用。</p>\n<p>变量规则与最终规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{T,\\mathsf{var}}\n=\n\\{((),\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash x:A):x:A\\in\\Gamma\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{T,\\mathsf{var}}\n=\n\\{((),\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash x:A):x:A\\in\\Gamma\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{T}\n=\n\\mathsf{TimeCtxForm}_{T}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{T,\\mathsf{var}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{T,\\to}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{T,\\times}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{T,\\bigcirc}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{T,\\square}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{T,\\lozenge}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{T}\n=\n\\mathsf{TimeCtxForm}_{T}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{T,\\mathsf{var}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{T,\\to}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{T,\\times}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{T,\\bigcirc}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{T,\\square}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{T,\\lozenge}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-Shift-与时刻替换稳定性\">6. Shift 与时刻替换稳定性</h1>\n<p>对项构造子定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(c(M_1,\\ldots,M_n))=c(s(M_1),\\ldots,s(M_n))\">\\(s(c(M_1,\\ldots,M_n))=c(s(M_1),\\ldots,s(M_n))\\)</span>；其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(\\mathsf{eventually}(\\tau,M))=\\mathsf{eventually}(\\tau+1,s(M))\">\\(s(\\mathsf{eventually}(\\tau,M))=\\mathsf{eventually}(\\tau+1,s(M))\\)</span>，绑定构造子先作新名化。规则稳定关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ShiftRule}_{T}\n=\\{((\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:A),\n\\Theta;s(\\Gamma)\\vdash s(M):s(A))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{ShiftRule}_{T}\n=\\{((\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:A),\n\\Theta;s(\\Gamma)\\vdash s(M):s(A))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>时刻替换对所有时序类型和项构造子的时刻参数及子项递归作用。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-有限证明与可导性\">7. 有限证明与可导性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash_T M:A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists(T_0,r,\\ell)\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{T}\\ (\\ell(r)=\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash_T M:A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists(T_0,r,\\ell)\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{T}\\ (\\ell(r)=\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-整个形式系统\">8. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{TTT}=(\\mathsf{Var}_{T},\\mathsf{Tick}_{T},\\mathsf{Time}_{T},\\mathsf{Base}_{T},\\mathsf{Ty}_{T},\\mathsf{Tm}_{T},\\mathsf{TimeCtx}_{T},\\mathsf{TimeCtxForm}_{T},\\mathsf{Ctx}_{T},s,\\operatorname{FV}_{T},\\operatorname{BV}_{T},\\operatorname{FTV}_{T},\\operatorname{Sub}_{T},\\operatorname{TSub}_{T},\\equiv_\\alpha^{T},\\mathsf{stable}_T,\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{T},\\mathsf{Delta}_{T},\\mathsf{Jud}_{T},\\mathsf{Rule}_{T},\\mathsf{Der}_{T},\\to^0_T,\\to_T,\\vdash_T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{TTT}=(\\mathsf{Var}_{T},\\mathsf{Tick}_{T},\\mathsf{Time}_{T},\\mathsf{Base}_{T},\\mathsf{Ty}_{T},\\mathsf{Tm}_{T},\\mathsf{TimeCtx}_{T},\\mathsf{TimeCtxForm}_{T},\\mathsf{Ctx}_{T},s,\\operatorname{FV}_{T},\\operatorname{BV}_{T},\\operatorname{FTV}_{T},\\operatorname{Sub}_{T},\\operatorname{TSub}_{T},\\equiv_\\alpha^{T},\\mathsf{stable}_T,\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{T},\\mathsf{Delta}_{T},\\mathsf{Jud}_{T},\\mathsf{Rule}_{T},\\mathsf{Der}_{T},\\to^0_T,\\to_T,\\vdash_T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"8.1-完成核对\">8.1 完成核对</h2>\n<p>本文给出时刻表达式、时刻移位、三种时序类型构造子、自由变量、替换、初始判断族、目标差异、规则、推导对象、归约和最终元组。系统元组不含时间流结构、状态序列、解释结构或满足关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"356-时序类型论-Temporal-Type-Theory","text":"356 时序类型论 Temporal Type Theory","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-类型与项构造","text":"2. 类型与项构造","level":1},{"id":"3.-时刻移位、自由变量与替换","text":"3. 时刻移位、自由变量与替换","level":1},{"id":"3.1-时刻上下文与-shift-action","text":"3.1 时刻上下文与 shift action","level":2},{"id":"4.-类型规则","text":"4. 类型规则","level":1},{"id":"5.-归约与推导","text":"5. 归约与推导","level":1},{"id":"6.-Shift-与时刻替换稳定性","text":"6. Shift 与时刻替换稳定性","level":1},{"id":"7.-有限证明与可导性","text":"7. 有限证明与可导性","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个形式系统","text":"8. 整个形式系统","level":1},{"id":"8.1-完成核对","text":"8.1 完成核对","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}_{T}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tick}_{T}=\\{\\theta_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Base}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{TimeCtx}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ctx}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Jud}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta;\\Gamma\\vdash M:A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\Theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\mathsf{Base}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{base}(b)\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"A\\times B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigcirc A","display":false},{"tex":"\\square_t A","display":false},{"tex":"\\lozenge_t A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigcirc","display":false},{"tex":"\\square_t","display":false},{"